# Play vs Computer as Black: the computer opens, its moves and Submit follow the camera rules (150 ms after the move, so the flight
# reads first) and the player starts with the one board that needs a move in focus.
# Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250); Computer (492,254); Black (400,350); Easy (280,446); Standard (905,224); Play (808,712).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 492 254        # Computer
wait 20
click 400 350        # Black
click 280 446        # Easy
wait 10
click 905 224        # Standard
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 30
camlog on
waitai               # the computer opens 1. e4 (or what its seeded search picks) and submits
camlog off
wait 60
camexpect state Focus
camexpect visible 0 1
capture camera-vs-computer-opened
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 30
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 30
click 841 90         # Submit: it is the computer's turn, nothing for the camera to frame
wait 20
zoom?
waitai
wait 60
camexpect state Focus
camexpect visible 0 3
capture camera-vs-computer-replied
